{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You are an experienced doctor who hasn\u2019t been treated well by life.</strong> Seeking redemption, you specialize in the only thing you can still offer: <strong>helping others from within their own dreams.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through the <strong>most twisted nightmares of your patients</strong>, facing their fears through <strong>surreal minigames</strong>. Each treatment is a risk; <strong>one mistake can lead to trial</strong>, and every decision impacts your <strong>reputation and future.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manage your clinic</strong>, craft <strong>unique medicines</strong> based on what your patients feel\u2026 and work to become the <strong>greatest tycoon of Thornfield</strong>, a city where dreams are <strong>healed\u2026 or rot.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover Thornfield, a forgotten city where dreams can make us sick.</strong> Its inhabitants are <strong>unique and strange</strong>, each with their own stories and problems that only you can help solve. In Thornfield, <strong>nothing is as it seems, and every person is a world to discover.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Main Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/Dreams.gif?t=1749222734\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>40 unique minigames</strong><br>Each patient has their own nightmare. From impossible platforming to bizarre puzzles or a frantic shooter. Every dream, a new challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/Craft.gif?t=1749222734\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Medicine crafting system</strong><br>After each dream session, listen to how the patient feels and create the <strong>perfect medicine</strong>\u2026 or completely ruin it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/Judicee.gif?t=1749222734\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Decisions and consequences</strong><br>Gave the wrong medicine <strong>5 times</strong>? You go to trial. Lose <strong>$4500</strong>. And lose <strong>respect</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/Clean.gif?t=1749222734\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manage your clinic</strong><br>Receive patients, <strong>clean rooms</strong>, <strong>hire staff</strong>, <strong>upgrade facilities</strong>, and gain <strong>reputation</strong>\u2026 or go bankrupt due to malpractice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/Night.gif?t=1749222734\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Not satisfied curing by day?</strong><br><br>Decide to <strong>sell your potions illegally at night on the black market</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But beware: <strong>the police are watching</strong>. If caught, you could lose everything\u2026 and regret it later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/Wishlist.gif?t=1749222734\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>Support the project with your wishlist</strong></i></u><br>This game is completely <strong>indie</strong>, made with equal parts <strong>dedication and madness</strong>.<br>Add it to your wishlist if you want to explore the strangest side of dream medicine and support the project.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3775270?t=1749222734","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3775270?t=1749222734","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/2989d2b06ddbf462ac7dad28eea86d5429f8143b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749222734","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/2989d2b06ddbf462ac7dad28eea86d5429f8143b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749222734","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You are an experienced doctor who hasn\u2019t been treated well by life.</strong> Seeking redemption, you specialize in the only thing you can still offer: <strong>helping others from within their own dreams.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through the <strong>most twisted nightmares of your patients</strong>, facing their fears through <strong>surreal minigames</strong>. Each treatment is a risk; <strong>one mistake can lead to trial</strong>, and every decision impacts your <strong>reputation and future.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manage your clinic</strong>, craft <strong>unique medicines</strong> based on what your patients feel\u2026 and work to become the <strong>greatest tycoon of Thornfield</strong>, a city where dreams are <strong>healed\u2026 or rot.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover Thornfield, a forgotten city where dreams can make us sick.</strong> Its inhabitants are <strong>unique and strange</strong>, each with their own stories and problems that only you can help solve. In Thornfield, <strong>nothing is as it seems, and every person is a world to discover.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Main Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/Dreams.gif?t=1749222734\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>40 unique minigames</strong><br>Each patient has their own nightmare. From impossible platforming to bizarre puzzles or a frantic shooter. Every dream, a new challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/Craft.gif?t=1749222734\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Medicine crafting system</strong><br>After each dream session, listen to how the patient feels and create the <strong>perfect medicine</strong>\u2026 or completely ruin it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/Judicee.gif?t=1749222734\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Decisions and consequences</strong><br>Gave the wrong medicine <strong>5 times</strong>? You go to trial. Lose <strong>$4500</strong>. And lose <strong>respect</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/Clean.gif?t=1749222734\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manage your clinic</strong><br>Receive patients, <strong>clean rooms</strong>, <strong>hire staff</strong>, <strong>upgrade facilities</strong>, and gain <strong>reputation</strong>\u2026 or go bankrupt due to malpractice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/Night.gif?t=1749222734\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Not satisfied curing by day?</strong><br><br>Decide to <strong>sell your potions illegally at night on the black market</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But beware: <strong>the police are watching</strong>. If caught, you could lose everything\u2026 and regret it later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/Wishlist.gif?t=1749222734\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>Support the project with your wishlist</strong></i></u><br>This game is completely <strong>indie</strong>, made with equal parts <strong>dedication and madness</strong>.<br>Add it to your wishlist if you want to explore the strangest side of dream medicine and support the project.</p>","developers":["Papu's Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/007e6afd40bc0588e2004aad9a5e4c836dac0e04/header.jpg?t=1749222734","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257146034,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146034/movie480.mp4?t=1748622432","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146034/movie_max.mp4?t=1748622432"},"name":"Dr Dreams Simulator | Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257146034/330fe5df94ad837b0fba9511c55e4870c18b5464/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748622432","webm":{"4